  (text "TOUCH / CLIP ACCESS: local low-voltage reference only, no PE bond. Equalization is not earth discharge.\nBare two-hole same-net clip pads accept OPTIONAL hand-formed wire loops; no purchased contact required.\nNo permission for exposed energized mains handling or grounded test equipment on live mains.\nPlace clamps at their connectors, with short broad local returns; component ratings do not qualify this board." (at 15 254 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a5c63c96-6998-5115-a112-6e8b24cce73d"))
  (text "D110 is CONNECTOR-SIDE of D101/D102. Bidirectional topology preserves missing-ground blocking.\nD111 protects only the5V supply; no logic TVS is connected to AC line, neutral or PE." (at 15 199.39 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f5600c6b-37c9-5cef-be08-c7dea697ae81"))
